DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Azure: credit ends tomorrow, upgrade to Pay-As-You-Go
DESCRIPTION:The $200 trial credit ends 30 days after signup. Azure will ask you to upgrade to Pay-As-You-Go. The free VM hours stay free for 12 months after upgrading, but check the $5 budget alerts exist first (see deploy/DEPLOY-AZURE.md).
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Azure: credit ends tomorrow, upgrade to Pay-As-You-Go
TRIGGER:-PT0M
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Azure: credit ends tomorrow, upgrade to Pay-As-You-Go
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
