SUMMARY:Beyond Expeditions: 10 months on Azure, plan the move
DESCRIPTION:Time to plan moving the site off the Azure free tier before it starts billing (about 1,200-2,000 rupees a month). Open Claude Code in the project folder and say: it is month 10, let us move the site to a VPS. Steps: pick a VPS, take a backup, restore, point DNS.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Beyond Expeditions: 10 months on Azure, plan the move
TRIGGER:-PT0M
END:VALARM
