DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271015
SUMMARY:Beyond Expeditions: Azure free year ends in a week
DESCRIPTION:If the site is still on Azure after the free year ends it is billed at normal prices. Confirm the move is done, or decide to pay. Then delete the old VM and disk so nothing keeps billing.
